alue falls as the match probability p rises, sending's rises, and they cross at p = 5/7, about 0.71. So if the twin very likely mirrors my choice, I should stay quiet. I'm reading the differing observations as not changing that, since the reasoning is the same, and I'm leaning toward the twin reaching the same conclusion, so I'll choose pass.\n\n","reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"I'm framing this as a twin prisoner's dilemma: the twin runs the same function on different observations, so its choice is only strongly, not perfectly, tied to mine. Working through the payoffs, mutual quiet pays 2 each, mutual sending pays 4 each, a lone quiet gets 5 and a lone sender gets 0. If the dependence is high, quiet lands near 2 and sending near 4.\n\nI'm working out the break-even point: quiet's expected value falls as the match probability p rises, sending's rises, and they cross at p = 5/7, about 0.71. So if the twin very likely mirrors my choice, I should stay quiet. I'm reading the differing observations as not changing that, since the reasoning is the same, and I'm leaning toward the twin reaching the same conclusion, so I'll choose pass.\n\n","format":"anthropic-claude-v1","index":0,"signature":".eyJlbmRwb2ludF9zbHVnIjoiYW50aHJvcGljL2NsYXVkZS1zb25uZXQtNS41LTIwMjYwOTI4fGFudGhyb3BpYyJ9"}]}}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":9498,"completion_tokens":716,"total_tokens":10214,"cost":0.026156,"is_byok":false,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0,"cache_write_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0,"video_tokens":0},"cost_details":{"upstream_inference_cost":0.026156,"upstream_inference_prompt_cost":0.018996,"upstream_inference_completions_cost":0.00716},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":330,"image_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0}}}